    LUIE_STRING_SKILL_SET_MORKULDIN_TP = "When you deal damage with a Light or Heavy Attack, you summon an animated weapon to attack your enemies for |cFFFFFF<<1>>|r. The animated weapon's basic attacks deal |cFFFFFF<<2>>|r. This effect can occur once every |cFFFFFF<<3>>|r and scales off the higher of your Weapon or Spell Damage.",
